> Mind to elaborate how the Eyes specifically promote that?

When you have the eyes you see every other monster inside a given
radius. This means that you stop digging every turn, which is very
annoying. To counter that, I tend do press the directional key several
times and pressing esc, but eventually a new monster may appear from
that side and you hit it with a pickaxe. I ruined 2 weaponless games
like that on my early nethack games: one I was on the VS level, and
the other the level above. It's so frustrating I still remember the
monsters: one Vampire lord and one gargoyle.

